              </li>

              <li>
                <span>✓</span>
                Generate cron and systemd configurations.
              </li>

              <li>
                <span>✓</span>
                Build SSH, rsync, tar, find, and sed commands.
              </li>

              <li>
                <span>✓</span>
                Create firewalld, iptables, and OpenSSL commands.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <aside class="category-panel">
            <span class="section-label">Other categories</span>
            <h2>Explore more tools</h2>

            <a href="/devops" class="category-link">
              <span class="category-link-icon">⚙️</span>

              <span>
                <strong>DevOps Tools</strong>
                <small>YAML, JSON, Docker, and automation utilities</small>
              </span>

              <span class="arrow">→</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/kubernetes" class="category-link">
              <span class="category-link-icon">☸️</span>

              <span>
                <strong>Kubernetes Tools</strong>
                <small>Deployment, service, and ingress generators</small>
              </span>

              <span class="arrow">→</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/cloud" class="category-link">
              <span class="category-link-icon">☁️</span>

              <span>
                <strong>Cloud Tools</strong>
