      <section class="cta-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="cta-box">
            <div>
              <span class="cta-label">Gokuruvi Tools</span>

              <h2>Practical utilities for technical professionals</h2>

              <p>
                Explore free tools for Linux, DevOps, Kubernetes, networking,
